    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5990" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cădūsii</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cădūsi</span></b> ),
			ōrum, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Καδούσιοι</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a people in Media</i>, <i>on
				the Caspian Sea</i> (Atropatene). <i><span class="en">Mel. 1, 2,
			5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Nep. Dat. 1, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 35,
				48, 5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Just. 10, 3, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Curt. 4,
				12, 12</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 6, 16, 18, §
			48</span></i>.—In sing.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cădusus</span></b> , i.,
				<i><span class="en">Avien. Descr. Orb.
				910</span></i>.—<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cădūsĭa</span></b> ,
			ae, f., <i>the country of the
				Cadusii</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 6, 13, 15, §
		36</span></i>.</div>
